      <h2>Early Access Launch Timeline</h2>
      <p>Developer NoShadow has officially slated <strong>Scavland</strong> for release into Steam Early Access on <strong>September 4, 2026</strong>. Following extensive playtest feedback and reaching over 100,000 Steam wishlists, the initial Early Access release will deliver the foundation of Zalesye's hardcore survival experience.</p>

      <h2>What Is Included in the Day 1 Release?</h2>
      <p>The Day 1 Early Access release focuses on a fully playable survival sandbox with high replayability:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Handcrafted Overworld &amp; Bunkers:</strong> Multiple distinct sectors across Zalesye, including irradiated wetlands, Soviet bunker complexes, industrial ruins, and mutant nests.</li>
        <li><strong>Full Weapons &amp; Ballistics Arsenal:</strong> 25+ firearms ranging from handguns to high-caliber battle rifles, supported by modular attachment customization (300+ attachments).</li>
        <li><strong>10 Wasteland Factions:</strong> Dynamic NPC factions offering contracts, trading outposts, unique gear, and reputation systems.</li>
        <li><strong>The Mist Phenomenon:</strong> Dynamic anomaly scanner mechanics and hazardous weather shifts that mutate wildlife and spawn rare artifacts.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Platform Availability &amp; Consoles</h2>
      <p>Scavland is built primarily for PC via Steam. A console release (PlayStation, Xbox, or Nintendo Switch) has not been confirmed for Early Access launch, as the development team is focusing optimization efforts on PC stability, mouse/keyboard precision, and Steam Deck compatibility.</p>

      <h2>Price and Editions</h2>
      <p>Final regional pricing tiers will be published directly on the <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3373500/Scavland/" rel="noreferrer">Steam Store Page</a> at launch. There are currently no pre-order paywalls or microtransactions planned.</p>
